Cancel anytime</p></span><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-sentry-element="Link" data-sentry-component="Link" data-sentry-source-file="link.tsx" href="https://www.historyvault.com/" class="mpgbmc0 _1jnz0oc27 mpgbmc1 mpgbmc3 g1fwxflr"><div class="z0eoj31 z0eoj39 z0eoj3h z0eoj32" data-sentry-element="Button" data-sentry-source-file="link.tsx"><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipc _198y7ip4 g1fwxflu g1fwxfof g1fwxfil g1fwxfju" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx">World War II <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="g1fwxf106 _11axmyda _11axmyd1" data-sentry-element="svg" data-sentry-component="IconSvg" data-sentry-source-file="icon.tsx"><path d="M14 34L34 14M34 14H14M34 14V34" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="inherit" stroke-linejoin="inherit" data-sentry-element="path" data-sentry-source-file="arrow-up-right.tsx"></path></svg></span></div></a><div class="_42elsx2 _1kceyete g1fwxf101" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><p>Exclusions &amp; terms apply</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="i94vss1 i94vss4 g1fwxfnf g1fwxflx g1fwxfzr g1fwxfii" data-name="section" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="g1fwxf4 g1fwxf7 g1fwxfy g1fwxfy8 g1fwxflu g1fwxfm9 g1fwxfn0" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="1Sc3XU8SjCzZZG8wGqfcvQ" id="main-content-14" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_42elsx1 a0xfey3 g1fwxfzv g1fwxfzz" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><p>At the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-sentry-element="Link" data-sentry-component="Link" data-sentry-source-file="link.tsx" href="/topics/world-war-ii/douglas-macarthur-receives-the-japanese-surrender-rev1-video" class="mpgbmc0 _1jnz0oc27 g1fwxfm3 mpgbmc2 g1fwxflr">signing of the agreement</a> that brought an end to 2,194 days of global war, MacArthur told the world in a radio broadcast, “Today the guns are silent. A great tragedy has ended. A great victory has been won.”</p></div></div><div class="x4or4w5 x4or4w6 g1fwxfk g1fwxfs" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_5sgrw01" style="--_5sgrw00:0" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"></div></div></div><div class="g1fwxfyf x4or4w6 i94vss3 i94vss5 g1fwxfzt g1fwxf4f g1fwxf6o" data-name="full bleed section" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="i94vss1 i94vss4 g1fwxfnf g1fwxflx g1fwxfzr g1fwxfil" data-name="section" id="article-related" data-section-name="content list" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="g1fwxf9 g1fwxfz g1fwxflu g1fwxflz g1fwxfju g1fwxfil g1fwxfzq g1fwxfvw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="g1fwxfl0" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><h2 class="_42elsx8 _1y6xuyv0 _1y6xuyv2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Related</h2></div></div><div class="g1fwxfzq g1fwxflx g1fwxfw2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_1p47p4a0 g1fwxfy3" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><a href="/topics/world-war-ii/videos" class="mpgbmc0 _1jnz0oc27 g1fwxflr" data-sentry-component="Link" data-sentry-source-file="link.tsx"><div class="g1fwxflu g1fwxfm9 g1fwxfmx g1fwxfil g1fwxfl0" data-sentry-element="C