ncluded on the deck of an American warship on September 2, 1945, \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/topics/world-war-ii/world-war-ii-history\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"World War II\"]}],\" had claimed the lives of an estimated 60-80 million people, approximately 3 percent of the world’s population. The vast majority of those who died in history’s deadliest war were civilians, including 6 million Jews killed in Nazi concentration camps during \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/topics/world-war-ii/the-holocaust\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"the Holocaust\"]}],\".\"]}],\"data-sentry-component\":\"Box\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"_42elsx1 a0xfey3 g1fwxfzv g1fwxfzz\",\"data-sentry-element\":\"Component\",\"data-sentry-source-file\":\"box.tsx\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Germany employed its \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/topics/world-war-ii/blitzkrieg\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"“blitzkrieg”\"]}],\" (“lightning war”) strategy to sweep across the Netherlands, Belgium and France in the war’s opening months and force more than 300,000 British and other Allied troops to \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/topics/world-war-ii/dunkirk\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"evacuate continental Europe from Dunkirk\"]}],\". In June 1941, German dictator \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"5\",{\"href\":\"/topics/world-war-ii/adolf-hitler-1\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"Adolf Hitler\"]}],\" broke his \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"7\",{\"href\":\"/topics/world-war-ii/german-soviet-nonaggression-pact\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"nonaggression pact with the Soviet Union\"]}],\" and launched \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"9\",{\"href\":\"https://www.history.com/topics/world-war-ii/operation-barbarossa\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"Operation Barbarossa\"]}],\", which brought Nazi troops to the gates of Moscow.\"]}],\"data-sentry-component\":\"Box\"}]]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"x4or4w5 x4or4w6 g1fwxfk g1fwxfs\",\"data-sentry-element\":\"Component\",\"data-sentry-source-file\":\"box.tsx\",\"data-sentry-component\":\"Box\",\"children\":[\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"$La6\",null,{\"mainContainerId\":\"main-content-0\",\"relatedArticles\":[{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"4fRLjgtGAHr0aUmt31EHAp\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-09T19:08:05.513Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-09T19:08:05.513Z\"},\"componentType\":\"article\",\"subComponentType\":\"regular\",\"title\":\"These Photos Depict the 'Miracle of Dunkirk' That Saved 338,000 Lives\",\"subHeading\":\"These photos show the chaos and courage of the 1940 Dunkirk evacuation, when hundreds of thousands of Allied troops escaped German forces by sea.\",\"homepageHeadline\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/articles/miracle-dunkirk-photos\",\"slug\":\"miracle-dunkirk-photos\",\"heroImage\":{\"componentType\":\"cloudinary image\",\"sys\":{\"id\":\"4QHKZsMh3yWPczzC8ORZW2\"},\"slug\":\"dunkirk-welcome-home\",\"altText\":\"A soldier with the British Expeditionary Force, arriving in Britain after the evacuation of Dunkirk, is greeted affectionately by his girlfriend.\",\"title\":\"Dunkirk 12\",\"credit\":\"Getty Images\",\"caption\":\"A soldier with the British Expeditionary Force, arriving in Britain after the evacuation of Dunkirk, is greeted affectionately by his girlfriend.\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":675,\"publicId\":\"12_GettyImages-2658976_oey4cq\",\"url\":\"http://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/f_auto/q_auto/v1788890002/12_GettyImages-2658976_oey4cq.jpg\"},\"meta\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"1d64lILSgWOkci30rHypXb\"},\"componentType\":\"meta\",\"title\":\"Photos Depict 'Miracle of Dunkirk' That Saved 338,000 Lives | HISTORY\",\"description\":\"These photos show the chaos and courage of the 1940 evacuation, when hundreds of thousands of Allied troops escaped German forces by sea.\",\"openGraphDescription\":\"These photos show the chaos and courage of the 1940 evacuation, when hundreds of thousands of Allied troops escaped German forces by sea.\",\"legacyPublishedDate\":\"$undefined\",\"legacyModifiedDate\":\"$undefined\",\"thumbnailImage\":\"$undefined\",\"adCategories\":\"$undefined\",\"noindex\":false},\"topic\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"4bhWOA6U2NK4LN6KKuyZbL\"},\"componentType\":\"link\",\"url\":\"/topics/world-war-ii\",\"text\":\"World War II\",\"slug\":\"world-war-ii\"},\"subtopics\":[],\"collections\":[],\"sponsor\":\"$undefined\",\"authors\":[{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"1ldT9NnUg5MkRjDkp12Mtx\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-17T16:06:02.824Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-29T10:14:57.263Z\"},\"componentType\":\"author\",\"name\":\"Madison Horne\",\"slug\":\"madison-horne\",\"url\":\"/authors/madison-horne\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"image\":\"$undefined\"}],\"readingTimeInSeconds\":\"$undefined\",\"adKey\":\"apluse.hist.topics/worldwarii\"}],\"quotes\":[],\"adKey\":\"apluse.hist.topics\",\"adCategories\":\"$94:props:children:0:props:adCategories\",\"articleName\":\"world-war-ii-end-events\",\"quickFacts\":\"$undefined\",\"quickFactsLogo\":{\"componentType\":\"cloudinary image\",\"sys\":{\"id\":\"53yojx35aLOb7BAH34oJP6\"},\"slug\":\"quick-facts-logo\",\"altText\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"Quick Facts Logo\",\"credit\":\"$undefined\",\"caption\":\"$undefined\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\",\"width\":128,\"height\":33,\"publicId\":\"Frame_41451_khtydw\",\"url\":\"http://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/f_auto/q_auto/v1746023555/Frame_41451_khtydw.svg\"},\"data-sentry-element\":\"RightRail\",\"data-sentry-source-file\":\"rich-text-section.tsx\"}]]}]]]}],\"$La7\",\"$La8\",\"$L