KKuyZbL\"},\"componentType\":\"link\",\"url\":\"/topics/world-war-ii\",\"text\":\"World War II\",\"slug\":\"world-war-ii\"},\"subtopics\":[],\"collections\":[],\"sponsor\":\"$undefined\",\"authors\":[{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"1C5M4xmamIIRKjfq0kEFaF\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-17T16:04:46.039Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-29T10:16:51.116Z\"},\"componentType\":\"author\",\"name\":\"Greg Daugherty\",\"slug\":\"greg-daugherty\",\"url\":\"/authors/greg-daugherty\",\"description\":\"Greg Daugherty, a longtime magazine editor and frequent contributor to HISTORY.com, has also written on historical topics for *Smithsonian*, *National Geographic Traveler* and other outlets.\",\"image\":{\"componentType\":\"cloudinary image\",\"sys\":{\"id\":\"35w00AIas3uxb946I2EflH\"},\"slug\":\"gregdaughertyphoto-2\",\"altText\":\"$undefined\",\"title\":\"GregDaughertyPhoto 2\",\"credit\":\"Courtesy Greg Daugherty\",\"caption\":\"\",\"orientation\":\"portrait\",\"width\":2592,\"height\":2592,\"publicId\":\"gregdaughertyphoto-2\",\"url\":\"http://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/v1734088488/gregdaughertyphoto-2.jpg\"}}],\"readingTimeInSeconds\":\"$undefined\",\"adKey\":\"apluse.hist.topics/worldwarii\"}],\"quotes\":[],\"adKey\":\"apluse.hist.topics\",\"adCategories\":\"$94:props:children:0:props:adCategories\",\"articleName\":\"world-war-ii-end-events\",\"quickFacts\":\"$undefined\",\"quickFactsLogo\":\"$9c:0:props:children:1:1:props:children:1:props:quickFactsLogo\",\"data-sentry-element\":\"RightRail\",\"data-sentry-source-file\":\"rich-text-section.tsx\"}]\nc7:[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"_42elsx1 a0xfey3 g1fwxfzv g1fwxfzz\",\"data-sentry-element\":\"Component\",\"data-sentry-source-file\":\"box.tsx\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"In addition to the bombings of Hiroshima and Nagasaki, Japan came under increasing pressure when the \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/this-day-in-history/soviets-declare-war-on-japan-invade-manchuria\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"Soviet Union formally declared war\"]}],\" on August 8 and invaded Japanese-occupied Manchuria in northeastern China. With his Imperial Council deadlocked, Japan’s \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/topics/world-war-ii/hirohito-1\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"Emperor Hirohito\"]}],\" broke the tie and decided that his country must surrender. At noon on August 15 (Japanese time), the emperor announced Japan’s surrender in his first-ever radio broadcast.\"]}],\"data-sentry-component\":\"Box\"}]\nc8:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"_42elsx1 a0xfey3 g1fwxfzv g1fwxfzz\",\"data-sentry-element\":\"Component\",\"data-sentry-source-file\":\"box.tsx\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"On September 2, World War II ended when U.S. General \",[\"$\",\"$La5\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/topics/world-war-ii/douglas-macarthur\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"g1fwxfm3\",\"children\":[\"Douglas MacArthur\"]}],\" accepted Japan’s formal surrender aboard the U.S. battleship \",[\"$\",\"i\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"Missouri,\"}],\" anchored in Tokyo Bay along with a flotilla of more than 250 Allied warships.\"]}],\"data-sentry-component\":\"Box\"}]\nc9:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"x4or4w5 x4or4w6 g1fwxfk g1fwxfs\",\"data-sentry-element\":\"Component\",\"data-sentry-source-file\":\"box.tsx\",\"data-sentry-component\":\"Box\",\"children\":[\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"$La6\",null,{\"mainContainerId\":\"main-content-12\",\"relatedArticles\":[],\"quotes\":[],\"adKey\":\"apluse.hist.topics\",\"adCategories\":\"$94:props:children:0:props:adCategories\",\"articleName\":\"world-war-ii-end-events\",\"quickFacts\":\"$undefined\",\"quickFactsLogo\":\"$9c:0:props:children:1:1:props:children:1:props:quickFactsLogo\",\"data-sentry-element\":\"RightRail\",\"data-sentry-source-file\":\"rich-text-section.tsx\"}]]}]\ncc: